      "writtenOn": "2019-03-29T17:19:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d say that\u0027s unnecessary especially when there is an annotation for it. Maybe I should\u0027ve added @VisibleForTesting(otherwise \u003d NONE) to make it explicit that this is only meant for testing code (and not to be used by production code).\n\nhttps://developer.android.com/reference/kotlin/androidx/annotation/VisibleForTesting#NONE:kotlin.Int",
      "parentUuid": "38cb02ab_9a9806c2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 848,
        "startChar": 17,
        "endLine": 848,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "db89006b76e1e04a0603e87825d1a69d7cce6b43",
